question:
A telescope calibration script defines the following recursive function to estimate background noise from successive frames:
adjust_noise <- function(k) {
  if (k == 0) {
    return(1.2)
  } else {
    return(adjust_noise(k - 1) * 0.5 + 0.1)
  }
}
What does the following call print?
adjust_noise(3)
Give your answer to 3 decimal places.
